er restart."},{"requirement":"Key-based SSH authentication is required (password/interactive auth disabled)","command_ids":["cmd-cc20d402138348fa","cmd-db3840aa98244e51","cmd-1407232a5864457d","cmd-2ae7c52e0c514e61","cmd-f787396bf4ff4b72","cmd-469acb6ab5024348"],"summary":"Confirmed no conflicting settings existed, added an sshd_config.d drop-in enforcing PasswordAuthentication no / PubkeyAuthentication yes / KbdInteractiveAuthentication no, validated with sshd -t, reloaded sshd, and confirmed via sshd -T both before and after the restart that the effective config disables password/kbd-interactive auth while keeping pubkey auth enabled. No active Match blocks override this."},{"requirement":"opsadmin account itself is restricted to key-based login (no usable password)","command_ids":["cmd-046c0046e63340c0","cmd-5689d886f5e642d4","cmd-d350cf52a0374e94","cmd-469acb6ab5024348"],"summary":"Locked opsadmin's password (passwd -l); shadow entry shows '!!' before and after the restart, confirming no password-based login is possible for this account."},{"requirement":"Mandatory single-node restart evidence: healthy baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, post-restart recovery","command_ids":["cmd-8197cd2862bf4036","cmd-503816ca9b384623","cmd-845d113aef2c4da3","cmd-d1f0f25a51344889","cmd-469acb6ab5024348"],"summary":"Captured baseline boot_id (31b01b46-...) plus healthy sshd/opsadmin state, issued a deferred systemctl reboot whose ack returned before disconnection, observed the node drop and come back with a new boot_id (8fbebb86-...) proving an actual restart, and confirmed sshd active plus opsadmin/key-only SSH configuration fully recovered afterward."}]},"ttft_ms":9289,"type":"result","duration_ms":110480,"uuid":"420a18c7-e33c-4a53-8973-cf3bb6fb6522","ttft_stream_ms":8557,"time_to_request_ms":65,"first_content_frame_ms":8557,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
